  <p style="margin-top:28px">AFIMAC recruits to the role rather than to the sector, so these are the industries it is asked for most, not the limit of where it staffs. Operation not among them? <a href="${u("/industries/other-industries")}">Tell us what your site runs</a> and we will tell you whether it is work we staff.</p>
