  <div class="note stop"><b>This grid used to draw five tiles where the live page carries seven.</b> It looked <code>EXISTING</code> up by each industry's new slug, and the two split pages are recorded under their old ones, so Chemicals and Oil &amp; Gas silently dropped out. It now reads the redirect map, which is the thing that knows. <b>Worth a look anywhere else the two slugs are matched by name.</b></div>`,
    spec: `<b>Elementor:</b> Container (3-col) · EK Image Box ×10. Ten into a 3-col grid leaves an orphan on the last row — a 4-col grid or a fifth row of two. <b>The live page builds seven</b>; the other three go up with their pages.`,
  },

  {
